    "post_install": "Run pwm login once to connect your Perplexity subscription.",
    "docs_url": "https://github.com/jacob-bd/perplexity-web-mcp",
    "_note": "Uses your Perplexity web subscription via the community pwm CLI. The RelayBridge subscription seat strips paid-API fallback variables and consumes normal Perplexity web/search quotas. Optional PPLX_MODEL defaults to auto; validate explicit names with pwm ask --help."
  },
